                <note rend="inline" type="source">892.6363/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Siam</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Williams</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-01-28T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                                1922—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>6. Your 198 December 1, 200 December 6, and 3 January 11.</p>
                <p>Make no further representations until instructed and avoid becoming involved in
                    private negotiations or in controversy.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
